<p><a style="text-decoration: none;" target="_blank" href="/shiwenv_c35a60c1a8e2.aspx"><span class="timu"><span style="color:#A32A2A">静夜思</span></span></a></p>
<p class="source"><a style="color:#666666;" target="_blank" href="/authorv.aspx?name=%e6%9d%8e%e7%99%bd">
<img src="https://ziyuan.guwendao.net/authorImg300/libai.jpg" alt="李白" />
李白</a><a style="color:#666666;" href="/shiwens/default.aspx?cstr=%e5%94%90%e4%bb%a3">〔唐代〕</a></p>
<div class="contson" id="contsonc35a60c1a8e2" style="line-height:200%;">
床前明月光，疑是地上霜。<br />举头望明月，低头思故乡。
</div>
